# PART 6 — BIND SHELL

## 1. Bind Shell kya hai?

Bind shell mein **target machine khud ek port par listener start karti hai**.

Then attacker target ke listener se connect karta hai.

```text
Attacker
   ↓
Target listener
```

### Difference

Reverse:

```text
Target → Attacker
```

Bind:

```text
Attacker → Target
```

### Memory trick

> **Reverse = target calls you.**

> **Bind = target waits for you.**

